            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 82518,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Listelerdeki sayıların toplamını bilmek, iki aydaki haftalık kayıt sayıları arasındaki fark gibi farklı veri kümelerini karşılaştırırken kullanışlıdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"signups_june = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"signups_july = [\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Method call",
            "id": 82519,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listenin toplamını hesaplamak için, burada <code>sum(signups)</code> örneğinde olduğu gibi parantezlerin arasına listenin adını yazarak <code>sum()</code> kullanırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"signups = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(signups))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"68\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>sum</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>signups</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Negative numbers",
            "id": 82520,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listede <code>-3</code> gibi negatif sayılar da bulunduğunda, negatif sayılar pozitif sayıların toplamından çıkarılır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quarterly_growth = [\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(quarterly_growth))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>-3</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Save in variable",
            "id": 82521,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>scores</code> listesinin toplamını yeniden kullanmak için sonucu <code>total</code> gibi bir değişkende saklayabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>total</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>sum(scores)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>scores</code> listesinin toplamını <code>total</code> değişkenine kaydet. Böylece kod <code>22</code> yazdırsın.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min(scores)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>total</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>sum(scores)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82690,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sayılar listesinin üzerinde kullanıldığında <code>sum()</code> ne yapar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Listedeki sayıları toplar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Listedeki öğe sayısını belirtir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Listedeki sayıları toplar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>sum()</code> fonksiyonu bir listedeki sayıları toplar.</p><p>Liste <code>points = [4, 6, 3]</code> şeklindedir. <code>sum(points)</code> bize ne verir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>13</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Listede üç değer olduğu için <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">En büyük değer olduğu için <code>6</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>13</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
