          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 82692,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>sum()</code> sonucunu nasıl yeniden kullanabiliriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sonucu bir değişkende saklarız</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir liste üzerinde <code>sum()</code> kullanmanın sonucunu yeniden kullanamayız</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sonucu bir değişkende saklarız.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>sum()</code> sonucunu bir değişkene kaydederek yeniden kullanabiliriz.</p><p>Hangi satır <code>expenses</code> listesinin toplamını <code>total</code> değişkenine kaydeder?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>total = sum(expenses)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>total == sum(expenses)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>total = expenses</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>total = sum(expenses)</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Method call",
            "id": 82693,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir online alışveriş sepetindeki fiyatları <code>sum()</code> ile topla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(cart))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"86\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>sum</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>cart</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>cart</code> listesi üç ürünün fiyatını içeriyor. Toplam fiyat olan <code>86</code>'yı yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(cart))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"max\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"50\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"86\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>sum</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>cart</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Negative numbers",
            "id": 82694,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>sum(points_penalties)</code> değerinin <code>7</code> vermesi için <code>-3</code> ceza puanı kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"points_penalties = [\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(points_penalties))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>-3</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İkinci sayı olan <code>10</code> bir bonus. Ceza ile bonusun toplamı <code>7</code> olacak şekilde ilk sayıyı ayarla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"points_penalties = [\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(points_penalties))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-7\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>-3</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
