            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İki şeker miktarını toplayıp sonucu <code>total</code> değişkenine kaydet. Böylece kod <code>170</code> yazdırsın.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sugar = [\" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(sugar)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"max(sugar)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"170\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>total</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>sum(sugar)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
